,0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_111","f","003","sigh",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_111","Ugh, fine. But you still need to practice reading, or you'll get tricked when you're older. Let me see...==W== The Tale of the Tyrant? That's a classic.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_111","f","002",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.3],["w",0.3],["goon"],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_112","f","004","question",null,null,null,null,null,"InOutSine",0.3],["w",0.3],["say","avg1_112","Hey Iris, do you think the Tyrant is ... like, super evil?",0,""],["w",0.4],["chd",1,0,"avg1_112","a","002",null],["chd",1,2,"avg1_103","a","002",null],["objx"],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.8],["w",0.8],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","ttc_canal_daylight",0,0.0],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_111","f",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.0],["hide","avg1_111",0],["w",0.2],["show","avg1_111","f","005",0.37,-0.03,1.05,0,null,null],["show","avg1_112","f","002",0.62,-0.03,1.05,0,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.8],["w",0.2],["ctl","avg1_111","f",null,"attention",null,null,null,null,"daintou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_111","Of course! ==SEX1== sends demons crawling out of the pitch-black abyss to snatch up kids who skip homework and stay up late.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_112","f","005","question",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_112","But in this book, the Tyrant's not like that at all!",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_112","f","004","idea",null,null,null,null,"jushou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_112","==SEX1== farms the land with everyone, builds tools, puts up houses. Those are good things, right?",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_111","f","014","angry",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_111","That's bait! The Tyrant never shows ==SEX3== fangs right away. ==SEX1== plays nice and sets traps with sweet talk. Then, the second you let your guard down... Chomp! You're dinner.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_111","f",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_111","f","005","resentful",null,null,null,null,"tiao2","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_111","Aunt Allie says there's no free lunch in Nova; the Tyrant can't be good forever. If ==SEX== is doing good deeds, there's a hidden catch.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_112","f","015","question",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_112","So it's all fake? But c'mon, if ==SEX== acts good forever, what's the difference? That makes ==SEX4== good!",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_111","f","014","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"jushou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_111","You're only on volume one. There's a second book. And in that one, the Tyrant wants to conquer every single Monolith in Nova!",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_112","f","011","star",null,null,null,null,"tiao2","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_112","Wahaha! Conquer every Monolith? That's amazing! You'd have to be the strongest Trekker ever to pull that off. Right, Amber?",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_111","f",null,null,0.3,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["ctl","avg1_112","f",null,null,0.7,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["se","se_061"],["show","avg1_103","h","002",0.49,0.15,1.05,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_103","h","002",null,null,-0.03,null,1.0,null,"OutBack",0.7],["w",0.7],["say","avg1_103","==SEX1== should move the Monolith. Just a little.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_103","h","004","awkward",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_103","And the orphanage gets some sun. We'll be warm.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_112","f","007","idea",null,null,null,null,"jushou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_112","Hey, if they can conquer Monoliths, they can definitely move one out of the way!",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_103","h","006","flower",null,null,null,null,"tiao2","Linear",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_103","Okay. I'm on team Tyrant. Let ==SEX4== move the Monolith.",0,""],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg1_112","f",null,null,0.9,null,null,0.0,null,"InBack",0.8],["hide","avg1_112",0.8],["w",0.35],["se","se_065"],["w",0.8],["chd",0,2,"avg1_112","f","008","star"],["w",0.4],["say","avg1_112","Ha! Two to one, Iris! Amber and I say the Tyrant's a good person!",0,""],["chd",1,2,"avg1_112","a","002",null],["w",0.4],["stg",0,250.0,null,1.15,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_111","f","015","vexation",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.35],["say","avg1_111","Wait, how did it come to this... Listen up! The Tyrant isn't just conquering the Monoliths, ==SEX=='s going to destroy them! Then we won't have any Artifacts!",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_103","h","005","question",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.4],["w",0.4],["say","avg1_103","No Artifacts. Is that bad?",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_111","f","014","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"jushou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_111","Of course it's bad! See that big box in the hall that blows freezing air? That's an Artifact!",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_103","h","013","shock",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_103","No box means hot.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_103","h",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_111","f","005",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_111","And that phone you've always wanted? That's an Artifact too.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_103","h","012","sweaty",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_103","Amber wants a phone. I'm out. No more Tyrant.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_111","f","006","flower",null,null,null,null,"tiao2","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_111","Ha! Now the Tyrant-is-evil side has two people. How the tables have turned! ♪",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_111","f","012","symbol",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_111","Huh? Noya? Where'd she run off to?",0,""],["w",0.4],["stg",0,0.0,null,1.1,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["se","se_148"],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.71],["w",0.71],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","ttc_canal_broken",0,0.0],["cbg",0,-90.0,null,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.7],["w",0.15],["show","avg1_112","f","002",null,-0.06,1.1,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_112","f","002","happy",null,null,null,1.0,"tiao2","OutCubic",0.6],["w",0.3],["say","avg1_112","Haha! I know the Tyrant's good, that's enough for me! Don't need to read the rest!",0,""],["w",0.4],["chd",0,0,"avg1_111","f","014","exclamation"],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_111","And I'm telling you that the Tyrant isn't a good person...==W== Whatever, suit yourself.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_111","f","003","sigh",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["goon"],["chd",1,0,"avg1_111","a","002",null],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_112","f","007","music",null,null,null,null,"tiao2","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_112","Amber, dessert's almost here! How about I race you back to the orphanage! First one to the table gets first pick!",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_112","f",null,null,0.35,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["cbg",0,90.0,null,null,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["show","avg1_103","h","006",0.77,-0.06,1.1,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_103","h",null,"star",0.65,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["w",0.7],["say","avg1_103","You're on.",0,""],["bgm",""],["w",0.4],["stg",0,180.0,null,1.1,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.71],["w",0.71],["bg","ttc_canal_daylight",0,0.0],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.06,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.7],["w",0.15],["show","avg1_111","f","012",null,-0.08,1.17,0,null,null],["ctl","avg1_111","f",null,"symbol",null,null,null,null,"jushou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.25],["say","avg1_111","Hey, what are you doing?==W== Don't jump from there! Aaaaaaah!",0,""],["w",0.6],["se","se_070"],["stg",0,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.0,null,null,"Zhong"],["tsk","Xiao"],["ctl","avg1_111","f","011",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.3],["goon"],["w",0.4],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.8],["w",0.8],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0,null,null,"JingTouYaoHuang"],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.0],["show","avg1_111","f","010",null,null,2.0,0,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.8],["w",0.4],["say","avg1_111","Noya and Amber jumped off that towering Waterway without even blinking. Terrified, I covered my eyes. When I looked again, they had already stormed into the orphanage.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_111","f",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.6],["hide","avg1_111",0.6],["se","se_060"],["w",1.65],["film",0],["bg","city_creche_outside_daylight",0,0.7],["w",0.2],["se","se_231"],["fx",0,"fx_avg_noise",0,0],["w",0.4],["say","avg1_111","I still don't know how they made it down. I was too scared, so I took the stairs.",3,""],["w",0.4],["fx",0,"fx_avg_noise",1,0],["bgm","m18"],["say","avg1_111","By the time I got back, dessert was nearly over.",3,""],["w",0.4],["film",1],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.7],["w",0.15],["show","avg1_111","f","010",null,null,2.0,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_111","f",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.6],["w",0.4],["say","avg1_111","But even though they said the first one back picks first, they both left my favorite cookies for me. I've never forgotten that.",0,""],["w",0.4],["se","se_169"],["trn",0,1,true,true,0.85],["w",1.25],["bg","city_creche_outside_daylight",0,0.0],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,"stop"],["trn",1,1,false,false,0.85],["w",0.85],["obj","qstory_main_08_012",1,null,0.52],["say","avg1_111","I was a kid who was good at reading.",0,""],["w",0.4],["se","se_375"],["w",1.0],["chd",0,2,"avg1_103","h","006","star"],["w",0.4],["say","avg1_103","Iris, there's a kitten on the courtyard wall. Wanna come see?",0,""],["w",0.4],["say","avg1_111","No thanks, I'm practicing my magic circles.",0,""],["chd",1,2,"avg1_103","a","002",null],["w",0.4],["bg","city_creche_inside_daylight",0,0.8],["w",0.4],["chd",0,0,"avg1_112","f","006","music"],["w",0.3],["say","avg1_112","Iris, I think these two Artifacts Aunt Allie brought back might fit together! Wanna help me try?",0,""],["w",0.4],["show","avg1_103","a","002",0.54,-0.14,1.1,0,"speechless",0.0],["w",0.3],["say","avg1_111","Hmm, maybe later. I need to finish memorizing this incantation.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_103","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.35],["hide","avg1_103",0.35],["w",0.4],["chd",1,0,"avg1_112","a","002",null],["objx"],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.8],["w",0.8],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,"JingTouYaoHuang"],["bg","basement_light",0,0.0],["bg","circle_light",0,0.0],["cbg",0,null,null,2.2,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["film",0],["cbg",0,-1100.0,null,1.8,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["obj","qstory_main_08_012",1,null,0.51],["w",0.3],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.8],["w",0.4],["say","avg1_111","Once I got the key to the basement, I finally found what I was good at. Reading.",3,""],["show","avg1_112","f","002",null,-0.09,1.15,3,null,null],["bg","travellers_home_inside",3,0.0],["w",0.4],["stage",3,0,0],["w",0.45],["say","avg1_111","I wasn't like Noya, who taught herself swordsmanship and made friends with half the Trekkers in the Trekker Association.",3,""],["bg","city_street_daylight",4,0.0],["show","avg1_103","h","006",null,-0.09,1.15,4,null,null],["w",0.4],["stage",4,0,0],["w",0.4],["say","avg1_111","And I wasn't as fast as Amber, who could chase cats across every rooftop and alleyway in Emor.",3,""],["objx"],["w",0.6],["show","avg1_111","f","002",null,-0.09,1.15,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_111","f","002",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["w",0.45],["say","avg1_111","But thanks to my books, I could understand Noya's sword techniques without ever swinging a blade.",3,""],["w",0.4],["bgm",""],["say","avg1_111","And I knew every shop in Emor without ever leaving Ash District.",3,""],["w",0.4],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.8],["w",0.8],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.0],["stage",3,1,1],["stage",4,1,1],["show","avg1_111","f","002",null,-0.1,2.0,0,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.8],["se","se_231"],["fx",0,"fx_avg_noise",0,0],["say","avg1_111","My future was in those books. I truly believed that back then.",3,""],["w",0.4],["se","se_169"],["trn",0,1,true,true,0.9],["w",0.9],["bg","agency_daylight",0,1],["w",1],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,"stop"],["fx",0,"fx_avg_noise",1,0],["bg","city_creche_inside_daylight",0,0.0],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["film",1],["w",0.4],["trn",1,1,false,false,0.9],["w",0.15],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.15,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["show","avg1_111","b","002",0.82,-0.07,1.1,0,null,0.0],["show","avg1_112","a","007",0.18,-0.07,1.1,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_112","a",null,"star",0.28,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["ctl","avg1_111","b","002",null,0.72,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["w",0.2],["obj","qstory_main_014",1,null,0.54],["w",0.2],["say","avg1_112","Iris, we found these weird Artifact parts in the basement. Any idea what they are?",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_111","b","003","attention",null,null,null,null,"tiao2","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_111","Oh, that's a steering wheel. It's part of a rare Artifact. I know I read about it somewhere... Let me look it up. I'll bring it to you once I find it.",0,""],["objx"],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_112","a",null,null,0.18,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["hide","avg1_112",0.7],["w",0.25],["se","se_061"],["show","avg1_103","a","002",0.28,0.1,1.1,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_103","a","002",null,null,-0.07,null,1.0,null,"OutBack",0.7],["w",0.3],["obj","qstory_main_028",1,null,0.54],["w",0.2],["say","avg1_103","Iris. How do I use this gun?",0,""],["w",0.4],["se","se_077"],["ctl","avg1_111","b","002",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_111","These magic guns run on Neo Solution and activate with a magic circle. I can teach you the circle, but go easy on the Neo Solution.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_111","b","007","flurry",null,null,null,null,"tiao2","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_111","It's hard to get. Plus... The Grace Imperium cracks down on it.",0,""],["w",0.4],["objx"],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.6],["w",0.6],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,"JingTouYaoHuang"],["bg","city_creche_outside_daylight",0,0.0],["film",0],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.8],["w",0.8],["say","avg1_111","Winter gave way to spring, and the days kept slipping by. Before we knew it, we were old enough to leave the orphanage.",3,""],["w",0.4],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.8],["w",0.15],["show","avg1_111","a","002",null,-0.25,1.73,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_111","a","002",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["w",0.3],["bgm",""],["say","avg1_111","As the first batch to leave, we were fired up to take on the world and set an example for the younger kids.",3,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_111","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.6],["hide","avg1_111",0.6],["w",0.8],["say","0","But then—",8,""],["w",0.4],["se","se_169"],["trn",0,1,false,false,0.8],["w",1.2],["stg",0,90.0,0.0,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,"stop"],["bg","forest",0,0.0],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["film",1],["trn",1,1,false,false,0.8],["stg",0,-180.0,null,1.1,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["show","avg1_112","a","015",0.85,-0.07,1.1,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_112","a",null,"question",0.72,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["w",0.4],["bgm","m1"],["say","avg1_112","Iris. Amber. How much Dorra do you two have on you?",0,""],["w",0.4],["stg",0,260.0,null,1.15,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["show","avg1_103","a","009",0.17,-0.07,1.1,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_103","a",null,"speechless",0.28,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["w",0.3],["say","avg1_103","Zero...",0,""],["ctl","avg1_103","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.4],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["show","avg1_111","a","015",null,null,1.0,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_111","a",null,"attention",null,-0.07,1.1,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["w",0.7],["say","avg1_111","Wait, wasn't this your idea, Noya? We agreed we wouldn't burden Aunt Allie, so we secretly returned the Dorra she gave us. I shoved all of mine under her pillow!",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_112","a","023","vexation",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_112","Ahahaha... Oh yeah... Right...",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_112","a","012","flurry",null,null,null,null,"daintou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_112","Then what do we do now?! We're completely broke!",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_111","a","004","sigh",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_111","Unbelievable. You acted on impulse again, didn't you? This is what happens when you refuse to plan ahead.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_112","a","017","question",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_112","B-But come on! We had to show Aunt Allie we could make it on our own so she wouldn't worry, right?",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_111","a","007","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_111","I guess ... you have a point there. That's the only reason I went along with it.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_111","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.3],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_103","a","007","idea",null,null,null,null,"jushou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_103","No Dorra, we find our own food. I can fish. There are mushrooms this time of year.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_112","a","007","happy",null,null,null,null,"tiao2","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_112","Whoa, that's our Amber! Exactly! Living off the land is what a real adventure is all about!",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_111","a","015","vexation",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_111","... You sure know how to let yourself off the hook.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_111","a","004","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_111","Anyway, I refuse to play wilderness survival on day one.",0,""],["w",0.4],["stg",0,0.0,-10.0,1.2,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_103","a",null,null,0.18,-0.1,1.2,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["hide","avg1_103",0.7],["ctl","avg1_112","a",null,null,0.82,-0.1,1.2,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["hide","avg1_112",0.7],["ctl","avg1_111","a","002",null,0.6,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["se","se_021"],["w",0.2],["obj","qstory_main_01_010",1,0.4,0.54],["w",0.3],["say","avg1_111","I had a feeling this would happen, so I stashed a little Dorra away...",0,""],["w",0.4],["chd",0,2,"avg1_112","a","013","star"],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_112","Are you serious?!==W== Iris, you are an absolute lifesaver!",0,""],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg1_111","a","012",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["goon"],["w",0.4],["chd",0,0,"avg1_103","a","014","flower"],["w",0.35],["bgm",""],["ctl","avg1_111","a","011",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.3],["say","avg1_103","Iris is the best!",0,""],["w",0.4],["end"]]}